9/Majestic_twilight_in_the_Mojave_desert%2C_Landers%2C_California.jpg/500px-Majestic_twilight_in_the_Mojave_desert%2C_Landers%2C_California.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Evening twilight in Joshua Tree, California, displaying the separation of yellow colors in the direction from the Sun below the horizon to the observer, and the blue components scattered from the surroun\n\nding sky","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AMajestic_twilight_in_the_Mojave_desert%2C_Landers%2C_California.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/51/Golden_Sunset_Clouds.jpg/500px-Golden_Sunset_Clouds.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/51/Golden_Sunset_Clouds.jpg/1280px-Golden_Sunset_Clouds.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/51/Golden_Sunset_Clouds.jpg/500px-Golden_Sunset_Clouds.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Golden sunset illumination of the cloud undersides","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AGolden_Sunset_Clouds.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/b1/The_sunset_cloud.jpg/500px-The_sunset_cloud.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/b1/The_sunset_cloud.jpg/1280px-The_sunset_cloud.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/b1/The_sunset_cloud.jpg/500px-The_sunset_cloud.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"The sunset in Sydney, Australia","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AThe_sunset_cloud.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/3c/Tappan_Ze